From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zhangzhaohong-dev <zhangzhaohong.dev@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:32:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Honor transform contexts for fixed backgrounds

Port of https://github.com/DioxusLabs/blitz/pull/1756.

Adapted to the older establishes_fixed_containing_block here (no ContainerType import) and to accessor-based node ids in is_transformed.
---
 src/node/node.rs | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/node/node.rs b/src/node/node.rs
index 1fa2799..0ae0b67 100644
--- a/src/node/node.rs
+++ b/src/node/node.rs
@@ -2417,6 +2417,12 @@ impl Node {
             .and_then(|stylo| stylo.primary_styles())
     }
 
+    /// Whether CSS establishes a transform space at this node.
+    pub fn establishes_transform_space(&self) -> bool {
+        self.primary_styles()
+            .is_some_and(|style| stylo_taffy::convert::establishes_transform_space(&style))
+    }
+
     /// A lazy Taffy style backed by this node's primary stylo style.
     ///
     /// Panics if the node has no computed styles: layout always runs after
